- Create the directory if it does not exist, ensuring it has appropriate permissions for the current user.
- Set file permissions to `S_IRUSR | S_IWUSR` (read and write for owner only) using `open` with `O_CREAT | O_WRONLY | O_TRUNC` flags and `fchmod` or `chmod` after creation.
- other security issues when the code touches predefined risk categories (input, network, storage, FS, exec, auth, memory, crypto).

